WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:13.460
Conversations: every Instagram, WhatsApp and Telegram message in one inbox. Here you read a chat, reply yourself, approve the assistant's suggestion, or hand it to a colleague.

2
00:00:14.013 --> 00:00:25.470
At the top, choose the app, and use the filters to see only unread, waiting for team, mine, or bot. Search covers names, numbers and the text of every chat.

3
00:00:26.024 --> 00:00:36.200
Click a conversation. If the assistant has suggested a reply, the Assistant's suggestion card shows three buttons: Send, Edit or No.

4
00:00:36.755 --> 00:00:44.220
To reply by hand, type in the box at the bottom. Enter sends, and the slash key opens your quick replies.

5
00:00:44.769 --> 00:00:53.280
Take over from bot silences the assistant in this chat, so you can carry on yourself. When you are done, click Return to bot.

6
00:00:53.828 --> 00:01:01.450
If the customer sent a payment receipt, the receipt card appears right here, with Confirm payment and Reject.

7
00:01:01.999 --> 00:01:08.760
On WhatsApp, twenty-four hours after the customer's last message, only template messages can be sent.
